---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Cookies Policy">
	<main class="section">
		<div class="container panel" data-reveal>
			<h2>Cookies Policy</h2>
			<p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				<strong>Last updated:</strong> 08 May 2026
			</p>
			<p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				This Cookies Policy explains how Paramount World Records uses cookies and similar technologies when you visit our
				website.
			</p>

			<h3>1. What Are Cookies?</h3>
			<p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				Cookies are small text files stored on your device by your browser. They help websites remember user preferences,
				session status, and interactions.
			</p>

			<h3>2. Types of Cookies We Use</h3>
			<ul style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				<li><strong>Essential cookies:</strong> Required for core functionality such as login/session handling.</li>
				<li><strong>Preference cookies:</strong> Remember settings to improve your user experience.</li>
				<li><strong>Analytics cookies:</strong> Help us understand usage trends and improve performance.</li>
			</ul>

			<h3>3. Third-Party Services</h3>
			<p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				Some third-party services integrated into our website may place cookies, subject to their own privacy/cookie
				policies.
			</p>

			<h3>4. Managing Cookies</h3>
			<p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				You can control or delete cookies through your browser settings. Blocking certain cookies may affect website
				functionality, including account access and form behavior.
			</p>

			<h3>5. Changes to This Policy</h3>
			<p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				We may update this policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with the updated date.
			</p>

			<h3>6. Contact</h3>
			<p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				For questions regarding this Cookies Policy, contact us through our <a href="/contact">Contact</a> page.
			</p>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>

